WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.660
Pune, eighteen forty eight.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.680
Every morning, a young teacher

3
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:07.005
leaves home with two saris.

4
00:00:07.205 --> 00:00:09.205
Savitribai Phule was born in

5
00:00:09.205 --> 00:00:11.645
Naigaon, in Maharashtra.

6
00:00:11.645 --> 00:00:13.745
Married at nine to Jyotirao

7
00:00:13.745 --> 00:00:15.745
Phule, she learned to read and

8
00:00:15.745 --> 00:00:16.995
write from him.

9
00:00:17.443 --> 00:00:19.863
In eighteen forty eight, the two

10
00:00:19.863 --> 00:00:21.763
of them opened a school for

11
00:00:21.763 --> 00:00:23.203
girls in Pune.

12
00:00:23.203 --> 00:00:25.073
She was its teacher.

13
00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.647
Not everyone approved.

14
00:00:27.647 --> 00:00:29.967
On her way to school, people

15
00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:32.287
